  Id: ChooseFaction
  Title: Choose your faction
  Pages:
  - Army, Navy, and Sky defend the same base with different structures. Start with
    Navy in this mission. Additional factions become available later.
  - Open the Navy dashboard to buy a foundation and your first turret. Money, EXP,
    and Upgrade Points are separate resources.
